    "introduction": "Weir supplies engineering equipment and services used mainly in mining and minerals processing. Its products include pumps, wear parts and other systems designed to handle abrasive materials, alongside ESCO equipment components and digital tools. Customers buy new equipment and replacement parts as mines operate, creating an aftermarket business alongside capital-project demand. Products are exposed to heavy wear, making reliability, availability and technical support important. Revenue depends on customer production and investment, while process-efficiency improvements can support demand for upgraded technology. The business combines engineering design, manufacturing and field services, with mining activity and the need to reduce operating costs shaping customer priorities.",
